abstract: >-
  Forecast-aware battery dispatch for smoothing short-term wind-power ramps: scenario-based
  stochastic MPC with conformal uncertainty and a causal forecast-skill switch, validated in
  pre-registered studies on simulation and two UK wind farms (Kelmarsh, Penmanshiel).
